The spherical and Cartesian AKLT tensors are related by a physical basis change.
The exact tensors are

`A^0=Z/√3`, `A^{±1}=√(2/3)σ_±`,

or, in the Cartesian gauge, `A^a=σ_a/√3`, `a=x,y,z`.  The virtual `D_2`
