+   is a probability on `ℤ`; its first moment is the ordered change of the
+   boundary-window charge.  `(E-LR1)` is supplied by the live PROVED claim
+   **LR1-GEN**; the substantive assumptions are `(E-LR2)` and `(E-LR3)`.
