+`κ_L=Lκ (mod ℤ)` in (E.5) at `t=0`.
+
+*Justification.*  By D19--D20 and (E.1),
+`Q_L^∂=Σ_{x=0}^{L-1}S^z_x`.  Different-site terms commute, so finite spectral
