+
+**⟨2⟩5. QED.**
+
+---
+
+## 4. Honest claim text proposed for merge
+
+> **`SPT-M'` (replacement).**  Select the D19 boundary windows
+> `f_L^{edge}=1_[0,L-1]` and D20 Hermitian normal-ordered charge
+> `Q_L^∂=Q^H[f_L^{edge};ξ]`.  Under D26(INT), strongly continuous
