+> `Σ_mmr(m)=lim_j[ω^+_{L_j}(Q_{L_j}^∂)-ω^-_{L_j}(Q_{L_j}^∂)]` along its
+> subsequence.  D21(H-split)+SPT-E' add the physical projective-edge/capacity
