+<!-- ROLE: blitz lane spt-tpm; proposed replacement register for SPT-M'.
+     Donors: definitions.md D19--D22, D26--D27; claims SPT-E',
+     M-INDEX-fin, M-INDEX-spec, LR1-GEN; theory/memory-index.md.
