+*Justification.*  ⟨1⟩1.⟨2⟩4--⟨2⟩6; fixed-`L` convergence in (E-LR1) occurs
+on the fixed finite difference set `spec Q_L^∂-spec Q_L^∂⊂ℤ`.  This is also
+the fixed-window conclusion of live claims **M-INDEX-fin** and **LR1-GEN**.
