+### ⟨1⟩4. THEOREM `SPT-M'-TPM-spec`
+
+**ASSUME.**  `(H-SPT-TPM)`, including `(E-LR1)--(E-LR3)`.
+
+**PROVE.**  Every `(E-LR3)`-subsequential ordered limit `p` of the escaped
