+Under the optional full-sequence convergence clause, `p`, `r`, and the value
+in (E.8) are unique.
+
+**⟨2⟩1 (common time subsequence).**  `(E-LR1)` can be satisfied along a
+subsequence of every prescribed sequence, simultaneously for all `L`.
