+
+**ASSUME.**  `(H-SPT-TPM)`.
+
+**PROVE.**  The quantized outcome and ordered-law conclusions of ⟨1⟩1 and
+⟨1⟩4 hold without `(H-split)`, `(H-AD-edge)`, charge conservation, definite
+channel charges, or `(H-dress)`.
