+
+**⟨2⟩2.**  The ordered-law conclusion adds only `(E-LR1)--(E-LR3)`.
+
+*Justification.*  The exhaustive leaves ⟨1⟩4.⟨2⟩1--⟨2⟩5 cite only
+**LR1-GEN**, **M-INDEX-fin**, **M-INDEX-spec**, and the clauses explicitly
